WEBVTT

video-title-preparation
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.202
Kukonzekera

preparation-01
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.100
Yambani posamba ndi kuumitsa m'manja.

preparation-02
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:14.500
Yatsani kuwala kwa BIO. Dinani batani kasanu kuti musankhe kuwala kwamphamvu kwambiri.

preparation-03
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.500
Chipangizochi chimadzizimitsa pakatha masekondi makumi asanu ndi anayi.

preparation-04
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Valani BIO pamutu ndipo konzani lamba wake kuti ugwire bwino komanso usakuvutitseni.

preparation-05
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.700
Linganizani pakati pake ndi mphuno yanu. Yang'anani chala chachikulu chili patali utali wa mkono, pogwiritsa ntchito diso limodzi pa nthawi.

preparation-06
00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:47.100
Malo oyang'aniramo apendekere kunja kuti akhale pa ngodya ya madigiri makumi asanu ndi anayi ndi kumene mukuyang'ana mukayang'ana pansi pang'ono.

video-title-fundoscopy-sitting
00:00:43.944 --> 00:00:48.081
Kuyang'ana kumbuyo kwa diso wodwala atakhala

sitting-01
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:59.900
Kulitsani ana a maso a wodwalayo kuti muone bwinobwino malo aakulu kumbuyo kwa diso.

sitting-02
00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:08.500
Gwirani galasi lokulitsa pafupi ndi diso. Kwezani chikope chakumtunda ndipo tsamiritsani zala zina mofatsa pansidze ndi patsaya.

sitting-03
00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:16.300
Gwirani galasilo patali utali wa mkono. Ligwirizane ndi kuwala ndi retina. Mthunzi m'mphepete umasonyeza kuti sizinagwirizane bwino.

sitting-04
00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:22.000
Kuti muone m'mphepete mwa retina, pemphani wodwala kuti ayang'ane mbali zosiyanasiyana.

sitting-05
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:27.700
Ngati pakufunika, wodwala ayang'ane chala chake, chili patali utali wa mkono.

sitting-06
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:33.200
Mukamaliza kuyang'ana macula, yezani zigawo zonse zinayi za kumbali kwa retina.

video-title-fundoscopy-indentation
00:01:29.423 --> 00:01:33.727
Kuyang'ana kumbuyo kwa diso pokanikiza mofatsa

indentation-01
00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:42.000
Choyamba dziwitsani wodwala kuti zimenezi zingamupweteke pang'ono.

indentation-02
00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:48.500
Pemphani wodwalayo kuti ayang'ane kutali ndi dera loyezedwalo. Kenako ikani chida chokankhira pa deralo.

indentation-03
00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:54.000
Pemphani wodwalayo kuti ayang'ane kumene mukuyesa, kenako kanikizani mofatsa.

indentation-04
00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:57.800
Ichi ndi chitsanzo choyezera mbali yapamwamba ya retina.

indentation-05
00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:02.200
Sungani kuwala, galasi lokulitsa ndi retina zogwirizana.

indentation-06
00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:10.600
Muyenera kuona mpaka m'mphepete mwakutali mwa retina.
